Line 6 data
-----------
No Line 6 firmware, code or artwork is included. One exception, data only:
- web/app/focus-defaults.json and web/app/focus-helix.json hold Line 6's Focus View default tones (preset settings from
  Helix Stadium's built-in preset data) and each model's number and parameter order (from POD Go Edit's PodGo.sym
  and HX Edit's Helix.sym), included with credit to Line 6 / Yamaha Guitar Group. The EQ sets and two Victoria
  delay sets marked source "toneshift" are our own.

Line 6, POD Go, Helix and HX are trademarks of Yamaha Guitar Group, Inc. MORF-X is not made or endorsed by Line 6.
The pictures in web/app/devices/ and web/img/ are the author's own renders.

